very advantage asks you to surrender some of the faith you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you compromise to complete the hunt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/e0b4e911948aed8dfc512b49e5226f71.poster.avif?t=1784046268\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/e0b4e911948aed8dfc512b49e5226f71.webm?t=1784046268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/e0b4e911948aed8dfc512b49e5226f71.mp4?t=1784046268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BEFORE NIGHTRISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Hunter: Nightrise is a focused, handcrafted first-person adventure combining brutal FPS combat, exploration, hidden passages, and a story about pride, temptation, and belief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you travel into the castle, the more the hunt turns back on you—testing your convictions before you finally confront your prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One castle. One night. One vampire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find him before he finds you.</p>", "short_description": "Trapped in a vampire’s Gothic castle, uncover its secret passages and reach its master before Nightrise. Smash furniture into ammunition, pin monsters to walls with a stake launcher, and guard the faith that powers your abilities.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full 